<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-006" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming" source-id="s-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming-ws2311630">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">高宗明皇帝諱<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming:p001:m0006" ref="w4m_9tw_147">鸞</persName>，字景栖，始安貞王<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming:p001:m0016" ref="98q_mll_d6v">道生</persName>子也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">庚辰，立皇子<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming:p002:m0006" ref="w4m_9tw_147_C">寶義</persName>為晉安王，<persName id="c-nanqishu-006-xietiao-ming:p002:m0013" ref="w4m_9tw_147_B">寶玄</persName>為江夏王</p>
</text>
